SYNTHETIC – GET /model/nodeByModel/{d}/{id} of a system diagram element (sdExtSystem) on 8.1.17,
structure probed live, values synthetic
Structure probe on 2026-11-27 against an 8.1.17 non-production server: a build of the MCP that
printed only the element names and the name and type attributes of the answer (no values) read
two external system elements (sdExtSystem) of a system diagram that manages HTTP Connector
modules centrally. Both answers had this shape: ns2:Property ResourceType (String),
ResourceSettings (Map) whose entries are ns2:Property elements with name, type and the value as
text, and ResourcesLinked (List) with one ns2:Property Module (String) per managed module. One
element had the HTTP entries ServerName, Login, Password (Password), SSLKeyStore
(HTTPConnectorTrustStore), the other additionally the OAuth entries kept here. Element names and
the order of the entries are as probed; names, values and the module names are synthetic, and
four test secrets are planted (synthetic-secret-3911 … 3914).
